Package: traygolin
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Lucas Saavedra Vaz <lucasssvaz@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/lucasssvaz/traygolin
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.9), libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libglib2.0-bin, libgirepository-1.0-1, pkexec, polkitd, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: unofficial Linux tray app for the Pangolin VPN client
 Traygolin is a GTK4 and Libadwaita application that drives the official
 pangolin CLI: connect, accounts, exit node, DNS and routing, without a
 terminal. Pangolin itself is not included.
 Traygolin is not affiliated with Fossorial, Pangolin, or Trayscale.
